==Overview==
The Massive Buzzsaw Oven is a strong enemy that only appears in [[Nightmare Mode]] and [[Abysmal Mode|Abysmal Mode.]] It uses its oven with saws inside to stun nearby [[units]] for 5 seconds.

==Appearance==
Its body is a large oven with many buzzsaws inside followed by 8 wheels and 2 some sort of shields. It also has a sort of confident face.
