==Strategy==
*This unit is very strong with over 1.5M HP so high DPS units like [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]] would be really helpful. It can also stun units so [[Medic Cameraman]] or [[Camera Repair Drone]] would be a good unit to have in your loadout.
